{"synopsis":"Sebuah acara dadakan untuk serial \"fantasi modern\" yang sangat kusukai sampai aku rela menggunakan cuti tahunanku yang berharga untuk pergi.\n\nDan hari itu, aku berpindah ke dunia fantasi modern tersebut.\n\nSebagai karyawan baru yang baru saja mendapatkan pekerjaan di sebuah perusahaan besar ternama!\n\nPekerjaan impian dengan tunjangan yang bagus, gaji yang tinggi, dan bahkan atasan langsung yang baik dan cakap.\n\nDengan pengetahuan tentang dunia fantasi yang hanya kumiliki, aku terus dipromosikan dengan kecepatan kilat!\n\nApakah aku bahagia?\n\nTolong kirim aku pulang. Kumohon.","alternative_title":"괴담에 떨어져도 출근을 해야 하는구나","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"ch_28","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"ch_27","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"ch_26","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"ch_25","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"ch_24","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"ch_23","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"ch_22","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"ch_21","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"ch_20","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"ch_19","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"ch_18","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"17","chapter":"17","slug":"ch_17","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"16","chapter":"16","slug":"ch_16","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"ch_15","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"ch_14","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"ch_13","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"12","chapter":"12","slug":"ch_12","date